    {
      "source": "Create a configurer with the given <a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/SslInfo.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>SslInfo</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/SslInfo.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>SslInfo</code></a>创建配置器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> This configurer is applicable only to WebFlux mock\nserver setup. For a <code>WebTestClient.Builder</code> with a live server setup,\nor a non-WebFlux, mock server, an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a> is raised.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 此配置器仅适用于 WebFlux 模拟服务器设置。对于具有实时服务器设置的 <code>WebTestClient.Builder</code>，或非 WebFlux 的模拟服务器，将抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "You can apply the configurer to a <a href=\"WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a>:",
      "translation": "您可以将配置器应用于 `<a href=\"WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a>`：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Or mutate an already built <a href=\"WebTestClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient</code></a>:",
      "translation": "或突变已构建的<a href=\"WebTestClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient</code></a>：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For tests with a MockMvc server, refer to a similar facility to set the\nuser identity per request through Spring Security's\n<code>SecurityMockMvcRequestPostProcessors</code>.",
      "translation": "对于使用 MockMvc 服务器的测试，请参考通过 Spring Security 的 `<code>SecurityMockMvcRequestPostProcessors</code>` 设置每个请求用户身份的类似功能。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use methods on <a href=\"WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a> to modify test client\nsettings. For a mock WebFlux server, use <a href=\"../../../../web/server/adapter/WebHttpHandlerBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.server.adapter\"><code>WebHttpHandlerBuilder</code></a>\nto customize server configuration. For a MockMvc server, mutate the\n<a href=\"../../servlet/client/MockMvcHttpConnector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.client\"><code>MockMvcHttpConnector</code></a>\nand set it on <a href=\"WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用<a href=\"WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a>上的方法来修改测试客户端设置。对于模拟 WebFlux 服务器，使用<a href=\"../../../../web/server/adapter/WebHttpHandlerBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.server.adapter\"><code>WebHttpHandlerBuilder</code></a>来自定义服务器配置。对于 MockMvc 服务器，修改<a href=\"../../servlet/client/MockMvcHttpConnector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.client\"><code>MockMvcHttpConnector</code></a>并将其设置在<a href=\"WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a>上。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"WebTestClientConfigurer.html#afterConfigurerAdded(org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server.WebTestClient.Builder,org.springframework.web.server.adapter.WebHttpHandlerBuilder,org.springframework.http.client.reactive.ClientHttpConnector)\">WebTestClientConfigurer</a></code></span>",
